ncial results for the quarter ended 30th June 2020.  n  nFor Ravikumar Distilleries Limited  n  n  n  n  nR V Ravikumar Managing Director DIN :- 00336646  nDate : September 12, 2020tPlace : Pondicherry</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
